nts","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-03-04T05:00:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T22:43:51Z","closed_at":"2025-03-06T22:42:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee] (broken)\n\nv4.4.dev7.official [46c8f8c5c] (working)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 27 Feb 2025 18:09:44 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (nvidia; 570.124.04) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nStyleBoxTexture suddenly tiling and appears blurred. See examples below.\n\nedit: Forgot to mention, the Panel with the style renders correctly in the editor in both versions. The rendering issues only surface in-game.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI have a `StyleboxTexture` that uses a 16x16px sprite representing a border for tooltips.\nHere are the settings.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08e7a116-2cd9-4fe3-8a55-bb230be5b2e1)\n\nOpening the project in 4.4.0-dev7, here is a screenshot of the tooltip in game.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f4f8ed9-985e-41f3-83d6-7c281f13090a)\n\nHere is the exact same commit of my project, running in 4.4.0-stable\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cbf298e-69d5-4cad-802e-26d573970e4e)\n\nAs you can see there are white lines where the edge of the border is tiling. The texture also appears blurrier in 4.4 stable. Increasing the TextureMargin from 5->6px gets rid of the tiling (while adding an extra pixel of empty space around the content) but the texture still looks blurry compared to the SS from dev7.\n\nMy guess is there is some AA happening but I have all texture filtering / AA turned off as this is a pixel art game. Unless there is a new setting somewhere that is defaulting to filter/compress/etc\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19080465/repro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103552/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}